{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["On the shoulder-pieces of the efod — the shoulder-pieces of the efod come up to his neck on this side and on that side and are doubled over to his front, and there two stones are set at the heads of the shoulder-pieces, and they have chains that reach to the ḥoshen, opposite his heart, and it is suspended from them." "Stones of remembrance — as I shall explain further on regarding the tzitz, concerning which it is written: קודש לה׳."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:22.903287171Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}